{% endif %}## Development

This project uses [`mise`](https://mise.jdx.dev/) to manage tools and automate tasks like running unit tests and pre-commit hooks.

### Setup

1. Install `mise` (if not already installed):

   ```bash
   curl https://mise.run | sh
   ```

2. Restart your shell or source the mise activation script:

   ```bash
   source ~/.local/share/mise/mise.sh
   ```

3. Install the required tools and dependencies:

   ```bash
   mise install
   ```

4. Install pre-commit hooks (if available):

   ```bash
   mise run setup
   ```

### Running Tests

This project uses [pytest](https://docs.pytest.org/) for testing:

```bash
# Run all tests
mise run test

# Run all tests without coverage
mise run test-unit

# Run tests with coverage report
mise run test-coverage

# Run specific test file
pytest tests/test_example.py

# Run tests with verbose output
pytest -v

# Run tests with coverage
pytest --cov --cov-report=term-missing
```

